  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continuation of the project between Stockholm university and MSSL. The aim of the project is to decrease the number of individuals with physical or mental handicap that have to live in institutions. This b developing community based social service alternative care will be offered to social risk groups.</narrative>
